    "name": "Which Kitchen Storage Improvements Are Worth Paying for in a San Diego County Remodel?",
    "text": "Which Kitchen Storage Improvements Are Worth Paying for in a San Diego County Remodel?",
    "@type": "Question",
    "answerCount": 1,
    "acceptedAnswer": {
      "text": "The right kitchen storage improvements depend on what you store, how often you use it, the available wall and floor area, and whether the remodel changes plumbing, electrical systems, walls, or the room’s footprint. A design-build consultation can compare drawers, pantry cabinets, corner storage, island space, and custom layouts while identifying work that may affect the estimate and permitting process.",
